sdata> -- ADR-060: a parse error typed interactively must cleanly reset the REPL
sdata> -- session (matching Run_REPL's existing Script_Error handler), not crash
sdata> -- the session and not silently execute the malformed statement. The
sdata> -- session must still work normally afterward.
sdata> SET X = 7
sdata> RUN
RUN complete. 1 records and 0 variables processed.
sdata> LET Y = 1 +
Error: Expected expression after operator at line 1
sdata> NOTE X
7.00000
sdata> QUIT
